<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Agip 1996 Q3 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Agip 1996 Q3 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Nigerian oil marketer Agip to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996     1995</p>
<p>Turnover			  4,300 vs 4,000</p>
<p>Profit before</p>
<p> taxation (core business)   227.5 vs  172.3</p>
<p>Profit before</p>
<p>taxation (non-core business)  7.6 vs   7.6</p>
<p>Taxation			   66.2 vs  60.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	169   vs 119.7</p>
</text>
